    text: "Affected southbound trips:\r\n3:11 pm from Union Station Track 12\r\n\nAffected northbound trips:\r\n4:25 pm from Ridgegate Parkway Station\r\n\nAffected stops:\r\nRidgegate Parkway Station\r\nLone Tree City Center Station\r\nSky Ridge Station\r\nLincoln Station\r\nCounty Line Station\r\nDry Creek Station\r\nArapahoe at Village Center Station\r\nOrchard Station\r\nBelleview Station\r\nSouthmoor Station\r\nYale Station\r\nColorado Station\r\nUniversity of Denver Station\r\nLouisiana / Pearl Station\r\nI-25 / Broadway Station\r\nAlameda Station"
